`Adler32.cs` in this directory is derived from SharpZipLib
(https://github.com/icsharpcode/SharpZipLib), file
`src/ICSharpCode.SharpZipLib/Checksum/Adler32.cs`, which is distributed under the
following licence. The derived file adds pal-csharp annotations and adapts the method
signature as described in its own header comment; the algorithm and the loop are
SharpZipLib's.

`Adler32Variant.cs` is not derived from SharpZipLib: it is an independently written
equivalent, present as the §7.2 variant test.

The rest of pal-csharp is licensed separately; see the LICENSE file at the repository
root.

